WEBVTT

00:00:29.632 --> 00:00:32.073
what's going on in shipping?

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:34.644
And I thought, would that happen
in any other industry?

00:00:34.644 --> 00:00:38.155
Would we see 544 airline pilots

00:00:38.155 --> 00:00:39.785
held captive in their jumbo jets

00:00:39.785 --> 00:00:43.272
on a runway for months, or a year?

00:00:43.272 --> 00:00:47.098
Would we see 544 Greyhound bus drivers?

00:00:47.098 --> 00:00:48.977
It wouldn't happen.

00:00:48.977 --> 00:00:51.755
So I started to get intrigued.

00:00:51.755 --> 00:00:54.269
And I discovered another fact,

00:00:54.269 --> 00:00:56.252
which to me was more astonishing

00:00:56.252 --> 00:00:59.337
almost for the fact that I hadn't known it before

00:00:59.337 --> 00:01:01.996
at the age of 42, 43.